        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-CLAYSCAPE-LIVING-LAB-THEOREMS-41-45.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-CLAYSCAPE-LL-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH41-SPATIAL-DISJOINT-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH42-HAPTIC-RELAX-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH43-RIB-HOMOMORPH-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH44-QUAD-HELIX-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH45-WEAR-OBSERVER-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-CLAYSCAPE-LL-WITNESS     PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-CLAYSCAPE-LL.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-CLAYSCAPE-LL.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH41-SPATIAL-DISJOINT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH42-HAPTIC-RELAX-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH43-RIB-HOMOMORPH-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH44-QUAD-HELIX-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH45-WEAR-OBSERVER-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-CLAYSCAPE-LL-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-CLAYSCAPE-LL-WITNESS.
